Software in mirx-ui.exe and its licences
========================================

mirx-ui.exe is built from the Rust crates below, each under the licence it
is listed under. The source code of every crate is published on crates.io,
at https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>, except for mirx's own
(mirx-core, mirx-ui) and for matrix-sdk and matrix-sdk-common, which are
those crates' published versions with fixes: their source, and what was
changed, is in mirx's source repository (vendor/, see VENDORED.md there).

The MinGW-w64 runtime it is linked with has its notices in
COPYING.MinGW-w64-runtime.txt.

